    "faq": [
      {
        "question": "What does this skill help release?",
        "answer": "It helps release individual plugins inside a Claude Code plugin marketplace."
      },
      {
        "question": "Does it support independent plugin versions?",
        "answer": "Yes. The documented workflow updates the selected plugin while leaving other plugins unchanged."
      },
      {
        "question": "What tools are required?",
        "answer": "It expects GitHub CLI authentication, a clean or reviewed git state, and the referenced project scripts."
      },
      {
        "question": "Does the skill include the release script?",
        "answer": "No. The skill documents how to use scripts that must already exist in the marketplace project."
      },
      {
        "question": "Can it create GitHub releases?",
        "answer": "The documented workflow creates commits, tags, pushes them, and creates a GitHub release when the script is available."
      },
      {
        "question": "Should I review changes before publishing?",
